path = "rpc/filter_feed_setter_test.go"
lines = 19
verdict = "clean"
note = "Read all 19 lines. Real HTTP requests exercise the registered eth and pax namespaces and require an error object with numeric -32601 and no result. setReceiptLogFeed is unexported, and its exported test shim is a package function. This agrees with 7002.5 and the served goldens; the pax legacy gate can independently refuse the name, so the reflected-set coverage is material corroboration."

